  "cards": {
    "window": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "铁栏窗",
        "en": "The barred window"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "梵高在信里写道：“透过装着铁栏的窗户，我能看到一片围起来的麦田。”",
        "en": "Van Gogh wrote: \"Through the iron-barred window, I can see an enclosed square of wheat.\""
      }
    },
    "before": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "日出前",
        "en": "Before sunrise"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "画的是他房间东窗外，日出前的景色。",
        "en": "It shows the view from his east-facing window, just before sunrise."
      }
    },
    "village": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "想象的村庄",
        "en": "An imagined village"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "画里的村庄是他加上去的，从窗口其实看不到。",
        "en": "The village was his own addition; it could not be seen from the window."
      }
    },
    "cypress": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "柏树",
        "en": "The cypress"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "近处的柏树被他画得又高又大，像一团升起的火焰。同一个夏天，他在《麦田与柏树》里也画了柏树。",
        "en": "In the foreground, the cypress rises tall and dark, like a flame. That same summer, he painted cypresses in *A Wheatfield, with Cypresses* too."
      },
      "link": {
        "scene": "wheatfield-cypresses",
        "href": "../wheatfield-cypresses/",
        "label": {
          "zh": "去看《麦田与柏树》",
          "en": "See *A Wheatfield, with Cypresses*"
        }
      }
    },
    "day": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "白天画的星夜",
        "en": "A night painted by day"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "这幅星夜，其实是白天在他一楼的画室里画的。",
        "en": "This starry night was actually painted by day, in his ground-floor studio."
      }
    },
    "times": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "二十一次",
        "en": "Twenty-one times"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "窗外这片景色，他至少画过21次，有日出，有月亮升起，有晴天，也有雨天。",
        "en": "He painted the view from this window at least 21 times: at sunrise and moonrise, on sunny days and rainy ones."
      }
    }
  },
  "exclusive": {
    "_说明": "独家发现两个开关：①“推开窗”：开场在疗养院房间里，透过铁栏看窗外；点一下，墙和铁栏淡出，走进星空下的风景。②“去掉想象”：村庄慢慢淡出，原画也换成去掉村庄的版本（images/starry-night-no-village.jpg，是我们用原画别处的笔触盖住村庄做的示意图），并显示卡片 3 的文字。",
    "type": "toggles",
    "label": {
      "zh": "推开窗 · 去掉想象的村庄",
      "en": "Open the window · Hide the imagined village"
    },
    "toggles": [
      {
        "id": "window",
        "label": {
          "zh": "推开窗",
          "en": "Open the window"
        },
        "targets": [
          "window-wall"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "imagine",
        "label": {
          "zh": "去掉想象的村庄",
          "en": "Hide the imagined village"
        },
        "targets": [
          "village",
          "church"
        ],
        "paintAlt": "images/starry-night-no-village.jpg",
