        "text": {
          "zh": "1889年5月，他自愿住进圣雷米的疗养院。从房间装着铁栏的东窗，他能看到一片围起来的麦田，远处是山。他一次又一次地画这片景色。",
          "en": "In May 1889, he voluntarily entered the asylum at Saint-Rémy. From the barred east window of his room he could see a walled wheat field and the hills beyond. He painted this view again and again."
